OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,FThousands more homes could be built
OL,8,Fnear railway stations, pubs will be
OL,9,Fgiven extra protection from being
OL,10,Fclosed and the planning system will be
OL,11,Fstreamlined under new measures set out
OL,12,Fby the Government.
OL,14,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner said
OL,15,Fthe shift to a "default yes" to
OL,16,Fdevelopments around stations in
OL,17,FEngland would help "tackle the housing
OL,18,Fcrisis and raise living standards".
OL,26,@wD@POUwD@\O]yD@TOUzD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
