FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,FThe change comes with the Government
OL,8,Fjust over a quarter of the way to its
OL,9,Ftarget of building 1.5 million homes
OL,10,Fin England after two years of the five-
OL,11,Fyear parliament.
OL,13,FUnder the new National Planning Policy
OL,14,FFramework published on Monday there
OL,15,Fwill be default approval for homes
OL,16,Fbuilt within "reasonable walking
OL,17,Fdistance of well-connected stations".
OL,26,@xD@NOUyD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,FMs Rayner said: "A safe, secure home
OL,8,Fis the foundation of opportunity, but
OL,9,Ftoo many people are being priced out
OL,10,Fof the communities where they want to
OL,11,Flive and work.
OL,13,F"By unlocking thousands of homes
OL,14,Faround well-connected transport hubs,
OL,15,Fwe're helping people live closer to
OL,16,Fwork, school and the services they
OL,17,Frely on, while backing local
OL,18,Fbusinesses and driving growth in our
OL,19,Fcommunities.
OL,26,@oD@QOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,F"That's how we'll tackle the housing
OL,8,Fcrisis and raise living standards for
OL,9,Fpeople in every corner of the country."
OL,11,FDespite Prime Minister Andy Burnham's
OL,12,Fpromises of devolution, the planning
OL,13,Fshake-up will also mean conflicting
OL,14,Flocal positions will carry less weight
OL,15,Fif they are inconsistent with national
OL,16,Fdecision-making policies.
OL,18,FThe plans to protect pubs will make it
OL,19,Fharder for developers to turn them
OL,20,Finto flats or shops.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,FOfficials said pubs and music venues
OL,8,Fare the lifeblood of communities and
OL,9,Fthe changes will prevent them from
OL,10,Fbeing lost without good reason.
OL,12,FUnder the changes, which will come
OL,13,Finto effect immediately, developers
OL,14,Fmust prove there is no reasonable
OL,15,Fprospect of keeping a pub afloat
OL,16,Fbefore a change of use can be
OL,17,Fconsidered, the Sunday Times reported.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,FThe shake-up will also cut bureaucracy
OL,8,Fby ending the statutory requirement to
OL,9,Fconsult some organisations on
OL,10,Fdevelopment decisions.
OL,12,FUnder the new system Sport England
OL,13,Fwill continue to advise on
OL,14,F"significant" cases and the Gardens
OL,15,FTrust and Theatres Trust will only be
OL,16,Fnotified about relevant applications.
OL,18,FChancellor John Healey said: "We want
OL,19,Fto drive growth in every postcode and
OL,20,Fhelp more working people into home
OL,21,Fownership.
OL,26,@vD@AOUvD@MO]zD@^OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
