OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,F"A secure home is the heart of all our
OL,8,Flives, helping people put down roots,
OL,9,Fplan for the future and build a good
OL,10,Flife for themselves and their families.
OL,12,F"This is about creating opportunity,
OL,13,Fprosperity and stronger communities
OL,14,Facross the country."
OL,16,FThe latest estimate is that 392,400
OL,17,Fnet additional homes had been
OL,18,Fdelivered in England between July 2024
OL,19,Fwhen Labour came into office and June
OL,20,F14 this year.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUvD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,FAround 600,000 new homes would need to
OL,8,Fhave been added in the first two years
OL,9,Fto keep pace with the 1.5 million
OL,10,Ftarget over five years, although
OL,11,Fministers are hopeful that planning
OL,12,Freforms will speed up delivery in the
OL,13,Fcoming years.
OL,15,FThe Garden Trust said it was
OL,16,F"devastating news" that the
OL,17,Forganisation would no longer be a
OL,18,Fstatutory consultee, warning it will
OL,19,Fput parks at risk.
OL,26,@xD@AOUxD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
