PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,FTrust chairman John Watkins said:
OL,8,F"This devalues these special places
OL,9,Fand makes them vulnerable to poorly
OL,10,Finformed development."
OL,12,FShadow housing secretary Sir James
OL,13,FCleverly said Labour was "failing
OL,14,Fabysmally" to meet the 1.5 million
OL,15,Fhomes target.
OL,26,@pD@AOUrD@VO]uD@ZOUvD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
