CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,F"To try to fix their own mess, Labour
OL,8,Fare planning a power grab, seizing
OL,9,Fcontrol from local communities and
OL,10,Fforcing them to accept development in
OL,11,Fthe wrong areas because Labour won't
OL,12,Fbuild in the right areas," he said.
OL,14,FSir James said Mr Burnham "is going to
OL,15,Foverrule councils on green belt
OL,16,Fdevelopment and launch a new campaign
OL,17,Fof garden grabbing".
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@ZO]vD@[OUyD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
