SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786929479
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises action to
OL,4,Ctackle housing crisis with planning
OL,5,Cshake-up
OL,7,FReform UK's deputy leader Richard Tice
OL,8,Fsaid: "These reforms are in direct
OL,9,Fcontradiction of Andy Burnham's
OL,10,Fdevolution agenda.
OL,12,F"Far from empowering local councils
OL,13,Fwho actually know their communities,
OL,14,Fthey strip power from the people who
OL,15,Flive there and hand it to Whitehall so
OL,16,Fministers can ram through major
OL,17,Fhousing developments while sidelining
OL,18,Fresidents and ignoring the
OL,19,Finfrastructure that already can't
OL,20,Fcope."
OL,26,@pD@GOUtD@AOU|D@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/11
